  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tCapium 365\n\t\tCapium 365 (Accountant)\n\n### Assign users to specific clients\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Thu, 24 Jul, 2025 at  4:33 PM\n\n\t\tManaging user access helps keep workflows organised and efficient. In Capium 365, you can easily assign users to specific clients. This guide walks you through the process in just a few steps. \n\nCapium 365\n\nNavigation: Capium 365 > Manage > User\n\nTo begin, locate the user you'd like to edit. Click on the ID number next to their name, this will open the user’s detailed profile.\n\nScroll down to the Clients section. Here, you’ll see a list of available clients. To assign a client to this user, simply check the box next to the client’s name and save.\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000118596\">Capium 365</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000200518\">Capium 365 (Accountant)</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">Assign users to specific clients\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Thu, 24 Jul, 2025 at  4:33 PM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<p dir=\"ltr\">Managing user access helps keep workflows organised and efficient. In Capium 365, you can easily assign users to specific clients. This guide walks you through the process in just a few steps.&nbsp;</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\"><u dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; text-decoration: underline;\">Capium 365</u></strong></span></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; float: none; display: inline !important;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\">Navigation:&nbsp;</strong>Capium 365 &gt; Manage &gt; User</span></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p data-end=\"242\" data-start=\"107\" dir=\"ltr\">To begin, locate the user you'd like to edit. Click on the <strong data-end=\"179\" data-start=\"166\">ID number</strong> next to their name, this will open the user’s detailed profile.</p><p data-end=\"242\" data-start=\"107\" dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p data-end=\"242\" data-start=\"107\" dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9234660914/original/lNY59XyqyLQlfutZvvAIXN5736OedPN7yQ.png?1753371114\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9234660914\"></p><p data-end=\"242\" data-start=\"107\"><br></p><p data-end=\"410\" data-start=\"244\" dir=\"ltr\">Scroll down to the <strong data-end=\"274\" data-start=\"263\">Clients</strong> section. Here, you’ll see a list of available clients. To assign a client to this user, simply check the box next to the client’s name and save.</p><p data-end=\"410\" data-start=\"244\" dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p data-end=\"410\" data-start=\"244\" dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9234661047/original/rFT9Q-rjXzA6KjWCJexGFzb_2zAzUjMHOg.png?1753371226\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-id=\"9234661047\"></p><p data-end=\"410\" data-start=\"244\" dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p>\n\t</article>\n\n\t<hr />\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<p class=\"article-vote\" id=\"voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000270005\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?<span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000270005/thumbs_up\" class=\"vote-up a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_up\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000270005\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-update-with-message=\"Glad we could be helpful. Thanks for the fee